Date: 10/26/2000
Crew: Vargus (Pa), Jyan (As), Farius (Av)

Before the discovery of the ranger shoot trick and dual funeraries, and after
smack heads and backstab got bigger delays, soloing Nimos and Lady Amber were
thought impossible.

Around this time the MUD was pretty inactive, and it was hard to get anyone to
do anything. So I thought, what the hell, if I get looted I can at least force
people to come and do some GK ;). It was time for Jyan to show his stuff.

